# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Unrelated Ren'Py reverse-engineering scratch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# These scripts and dumps belong to a different project entirely -
# they were dropped in this checkout by mistake and nothing in the
# app references them. They are ignored rather than deleted so a
# stray copy cannot silently reappear in `git status`.
#
# Every entry below is an exact filename, never a wildcard. A broad
# pattern like `out*.txt` would silently hide a future legitimate
# report such as `outgoing_requests.txt`, and would hide it forever
# because an ignored file is invisible to `git status`. The lists
# below are the exact names that were actually observed in this
# checkout.
#
# The extractor/dumper scripts.
rpa_decompress_index.py
rpa_extract.py
rpa_extract_index.py
